scripts/dev/xrs-lib.ps1 and scripts/dev/xrs-run.ps1 (the .xrs sequence runner, its directives and its
sequence format) and scripts/dev/img-diff.ps1 (the screenshot comparison) are adapted from the harness
scripts tools/xrsim-run.ps1 and tools/img-diff.ps1 of Dishonored VR, the VR-Main branch of
https://github.com/VR-Stereo-Hub/Dishonored-VR, which that project distributes under the MIT License
as part of the code it took from the bioshock-trilogy-vr project (see its THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).
Our changes (the paths, the test channel and status.json of this game instead of the Dishonored mod's
files, the added directives, BMP shots, the self-test) are distributed under the GPLv3+ like the rest
of this tree; the original notice below applies to the parts that remain. These are development
scripts: they are not part of the game or of the tester package.
